.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ttype 1  "ttype 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
ttype \- Terminal typing practice
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBttype\fR [\fB\-\-time\fR] [\fB\-\-words\fR] [\fB\-\-language\fR] [\fB\-\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\fR] [\fB\-\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-punctuation\fR] [\fB\-\-numbers\fR] [\fB\-\-blind\fR] [\fB\-\-zen\fR] [\fB\-\-min\-wpm\fR] [\fB\-\-seed\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-text\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-save\fR] [\fB\-\-result\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A terminal\-first typing test. Use \-\-time for timed tests or \-\-words for word count tests.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-time\fR \fI<TIME>\fR
Timed test duration in seconds
.TP
\fB\-\-words\fR \fI<WORDS>\fR
Word count test
.TP
\fB\-\-language\fR \fI<LANGUAGE>\fR
Language id
.TP
\fB\-\-mode\fR \fI<MODE>\fR
Text mode
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRwords, sentences, sql, go, backend, python, shell, regex, rust, custom]
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\fR \fI<THEME>\fR
Color theme
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRdefault, monokai, dracula]
.TP
\fB\-\-width\fR \fI<WIDTH>\fR
Typing area width in characters
.TP
\fB\-\-punctuation\fR [\fI<PUNCTUATION>\fR]
Inject punctuation between words
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRtrue, false]
.TP
\fB\-\-numbers\fR [\fI<NUMBERS>\fR]
Inject numbers into word tests
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRtrue, false]
.TP
\fB\-\-blind\fR [\fI<BLIND>\fR]
Hide correctness while typing
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRtrue, false]
.TP
\fB\-\-zen\fR [\fI<ZEN>\fR]
Words only: no header or hints
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRtrue, false]
.TP
\fB\-\-min\-wpm\fR \fI<MIN_WPM>\fR
Fail the test if WPM drops below this
.TP
\fB\-\-seed\fR \fI<SEED>\fR
Random seed for word generation
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Print the result instead of showing it
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRjson]
.TP
\fB\-\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Type the text of a file (\- for stdin)
.TP
\fB\-\-text\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Type this text
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-save\fR
Keep this run out of history, bests and replays
.TP
\fB\-\-result\-file\fR \fI<RESULT_FILE>\fR
Write the last run as JSON on exit
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Label this run
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ttype\-run(1)
.TP
ttype\-config(1)
.TP
ttype\-history(1)
.TP
ttype\-stats(1)
.TP
ttype\-languages(1)
.TP
ttype\-clear(1)
.TP
ttype\-doctor(1)
.TP
ttype\-update(1)
.TP
ttype\-completion(1)
.TP
ttype\-version(1)
.TP
ttype\-uninstall(1)
.TP
ttype\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
